---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for iptvsubscription.top: what information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and how to request deletion.">
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains what information {site.domain} collects and how we use it. We keep
    data collection to the minimum needed to provide our service.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact details you provide, such as your email address.</li>
    <li>Order and payment information needed to process your subscription.</li>
    <li>Basic technical data (such as IP address) used for delivery and security.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To activate and manage your subscription.</li>
    <li>To provide support and respond to your requests.</li>
    <li>To send order confirmations and important service notices.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal information. We only share data with payment processors and
    service providers as needed to operate the service, or when required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your information only as long as needed to provide the service and meet legal
    obligations. You may request deletion of your data by contacting us.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by
    emailing {site.email}.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, reach us at {site.email}.</p>
</Legal>
